<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE II: </span>Detailed characteristics of the three remote sensing vision-language models used in the few-shot benchmark.</figcaption>
<div id="S2.T2.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:82.8pt;vertical-align:-39.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-5.0pt,1.2pt) scale(0.971864571546765,0.971864571546765) ;">
